de-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-02T18:16:01-07:00","id":1086915,"title":"","content":"in the back, the name is only one when on my backer it there should be 2:<br /> <br /> What name do you want us to put in the Backers' Credits?<br /> Lady Seraphina Huntington (House Eiluned,Sidhe) &amp; Dame Taylor Cotton (Dalmation Pooka)<br /> <br /> Under Feldge section","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://i57.tinypic.com/10r2rtu.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1779-spider_one","name":"spider_one","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1779_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"84"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-02T18:25:42-07:00","id":1086918,"title":"","content":"All in all, my early opinions of the book are amazingly positive. I'm looking forward to trying out the new Cantrip and Banality systems. My congratulations and thanks to the entire writing team. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> However, expanding on Holden's post, there are several issues with the character sheet in the back of the book.<br /> <br /> 1) The Abilities listed do not match with those described in Chapter Three. The specific differences are highlighted below<br /> <br /> TALENTS<br /> Present but shouldn't be:<br /> Dodge<br /> Persuasion<br /> <br /> Missing:<br /> Expression<br /> Leadership<br /> Hobby Talent<br /> <br /> SKILLS<br /> Present but shouldn't be:<br /> Leadership<br /> Security<br /> <br /> Missing:<br /> Animal Ken<br /> Larceny<br /> Professional Skill<br /> <br /> KNOWLEDGES<br /> Present but shouldn't be:<br /> Linguistics<br /> Lore<br /> <br /> Missing:<br /> Academics<br /> Technology<br /> Expert Knowledge<br /> <br /> <br /> 2) The character creation example in Chapter Three implies there should be a field for Antithesis, perhaps somewhere near Threshold. There isn't one.<br /> <br /> 3) In Chapter Six, the rules for Nightmare Dice state that there should be a track below Willpower to mark off points of Nightmare. There isn't one. <br /> <br /> All in all it seems like the sheet was copied almost wholesale from Second Edition, possibly as a placeholder, and never replaced with the new sheet.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/79-alexisvalarr","name":"alexisvalarr","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar79_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-02T18:38:25-07:00","id":1086927,"title":"","content":"p. 317, in <b>Materials</b>: &quot;The stone for a king\u2019s castle in the Dreaming requires stone quarried from a dream realm and wood from an enchanted forest.&quot;<br /> <br /> It should read &quot;A king's castle in the Dreaming&quot; instead.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Luka Carroll</b><br /> Onyx Path Freelancer &amp; Developer<br /> <i>Working On: </i>C20 Player's Guide, Lunars<br /> <i>Worked On: </i>V20 TMR, Demon STG, C20, Book of Freeholds, Conquering Heroes, Building A Legend, Dragon-Blooded, The Realm","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3785-luka-c","name":"Luka C","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3785_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"175"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-02T18:56:21-07:00","id":1086939,"title":"","content":"Pg 152 in the character creation example Second Column - Arts and Realms. &quot;Soothsay goes on the list....&quot; I think contextually that should be Contracts?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5533-cameraobscura83","name":"CameraObscura83","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5533_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"151"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-02T19:02:58-07:00","id":1086942,"title":"","content":"Yeah, apparently none of the notes I put on the character sheet got incorporated, because Nightmare isn't there either. Grr.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13-blackhatmatt","name":"blackhatmatt","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"464"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-02T19:46:37-07:00","id":1086959,"title":"","content":"Boggan kith stereotypes have the autumn and Arcadian Sidhe switched. somewhere in the Arcadian Sidhe section (stepping out and dont have it with me) has Acadian instead of Arcadian written, will get specific place for this later","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5533-cameraobscura83","name":"CameraObscura83","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5533_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"151"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-02T20:01:56-07:00","id":1086963,"title":"","content":"Pg. 440, under the Slow Empires, the Empire of Flickers says Mannikins are their Phyla. Incorrect. Flickers hasn't actually been released as a Phyla yet. Confused about their entry here.<br /> <br /> Kinda dissappointed that Inanimae Slivers lost their cantrips. What's the reasoning behind this, besides page count? Think this might be addressed later?<br /> <br /> Not really errata, but kinda miffed the three Mer houses were left out, only given a slight nod. Not sure if thats errata or not.<br /> <br /> someone else mentioned <span style=\"color:#020621\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">the Thought-Crafters (a Nunnehi family covered in Kingdom of Willows) got left out. Overlooked?</span></span></span><br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3071-magusrogue","name":"MagusRogue","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3071_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"53"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-02T20:08:51-07:00","id":1086966,"title":"","content":"In the PDF bookmarks, &quot;Dauntain&quot;, &quot;The Harbingers of Autumn&quot; and &quot;Stranger Thing