k":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-02T23:30:12-07:00","id":1087025,"title":"","content":"Page 43: sidebar. &quot;and a generation of newl-dubbed Autumn sidhe have been reborn in the mortal world.&quot; That should read newly-dubbed.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4250-petersvensson","name":"PeterSvensson","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4250_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-03T00:24:33-07:00","id":1087036,"title":"","content":"So, it looks like I'm listed twice as a backer. Peter Svensson and Peter S. Svensson. (Unless there's another Changeling fan named Peter Svensson out there! That'd be neat!) If that is a mistake, just Peter S. Svensson would be fine.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4250-petersvensson","name":"PeterSvensson","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4250_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-03T00:38:05-07:00","id":1087040,"title":"","content":"Bunch of spelling errors under the Kingdom of Cymru (p. 75-76).<br /> <br /> &quot;Clwyd&quot; is spelled correctly in the opening paragraph, but spelled &quot;Clwd&quot; in the paragraph on the area itself. &quot;Clwyd&quot; - with the&quot;y&quot; - is correct. <br /> <br /> In the paragraph on Clwyd, the Keep of Birds is called &quot;Caer Adern&quot;. This should either be &quot;Caer Aderyn&quot; (Bird Keep) or &quot;Caer Adar&quot; (Keep of Birds). I'm guessing the first is what you were going for and the &quot;y&quot; just got left out accidentally, but figured I'd include the alternate option in case you preferred it. (For what it's worth, I think they both sound fine, but would probably go with Caer Aderyn). <br /> <br /> In the paragraph about Gwynedd, it's misspelled as &quot;Gwynned&quot; once, towards the end. <br /> <br /> In the paragraph on Dyfed, Prince Dylan's name is given as &quot;Prince Dylan ap Gwyned&quot; - should be &quot;Gwynedd&quot;. <br /> <br /> In the paragraph on Glamorgan, &quot;Pontipridd&quot; should &quot;Pontypridd&quot;. <br /> <br /> In the paragraph on Gwent, Clwyd is spelled &quot;Clwd&quot; once more. <br /> <br /> (I'm a Welsh-speaking Welsh person living in Wales, so that's how I'm able to be so pedantic! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" />)<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/187-beccatoria","name":"beccatoria","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar187_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"85"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-03T02:40:51-07:00","id":1087063,"title":"","content":"While I am always happy that a roleplaying game mentions my homeland (Denmark) I have to point out that there are no Volcanoes anywhere in the Kingdom of Denmark, not in Denmark, not on the Faroe Islands and not on Greenland.<br /> <br /> Specifically, I am complaining about the description of the &quot;Kingdom of Jutland&quot; and the sentence: &quot;The head of parliament, an outspoken horse pooka named Sachi Jensen, spends her time outside parliament hiking the volcanoes.&quot;<br /> <br /> You could replace volcanoes with fields, heaths, beaches (we have a lot of those), or even the Greenland Glacier, but remove the volcanoes because as I said, we have none of those.<br /> <br /> Furthermore, the name Sachi Jensen is utterly strange, there is literally no one in Denmark with the name Sachi, (source <a href=\"http://www.dst.dk/da/Statistik/emner/befolkning-og-valg/navne/HvorMange\" target=\"_blank\">Danmarks Statistik</a>), the last name is fine though, Jensen is one of the most common Danish surnames.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2792-drucchi","name":"Drucchi","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-03T03:29:52-07:00","id":1087079,"title":"","content":"Page 78: <b> The Pomeranian Alliance </b>cannot be &quot;located on the southern shore of the <i>Black</i> Sea and include much of northern Germany and the <i>Baltic</i> States...&quot;<br /> <br /> You probably meant <b>Baltic Sea</b>.<br /> <br /> Google Maps ref: <a href=\"http://bit.ly/2qrkEhE\" target=\"_blank\">http://bit.ly/2qrkEhE</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>...","edited":{"userid":5211,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5211-firkraag","user":"Firkraag","date":". 05-03-2017, 08:18 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5211-firkraag","name":"Firkraag","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5211_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"381"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-03T04:46:06-07:00","id":1087103,"title":"","content":"Hello, lads and lassies!<br /> <br /> I've been told to report here an errata about my backer name (Urtoroth Lobop\u00e1lido; page numbered as 477). As stated on the survey, the later modifications are not printed properly.<br /> <br /> As soon as I manage to have some time to read, I'll try to reoprt more errata, should them appear.<br /> <br /> Thanks a lot!<br /> D.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":13370,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13370-urtoroth","user":"Urtoroth","date":".  Added page information. 05-03-2017, 09:54 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13370-urtoroth","name":"Urtoroth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13370_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-03T04:47:19-07:00","id":1087105,"title":"","content":"The Picture for the Korred is either completely wrong or the description is. p448","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-03T04:50:07-07:00","id":1087108,"title":"","content":"page 34- &quot;so the mortals sought a sense of control and security in the nature&quot; should probably delete the &quot;the&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://rpg.drivethrustuff.com/product/134196/Chuubos-Marvelous-WishGranting-Engine\" target=\"_blank\">Chuubo's Marvelous Wish-Granting Engine RPG</a> \u2014 <a href=\"http://www.patreon.com/JennaMoran\" target=\"_blank\">Jenna Moran's Patreon</a> \u2014 <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/user?u=451515\" target=\"_blank\">Robert Vance's Patreon</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/215-rand-brittain","name":"Rand Brittain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar215_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-03T05:54:46-07:00","id":1087117,"title":"","content":"Kind of a minor thing, but could the Hsien cat please not be called 'meow'? Nekomata or any other actual term would feel less dumb.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ana-mizuki.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My gallery.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/110-ana-mizuki","name":"Ana Mizuki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar110_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2484"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-03T05:59:06-07:00","id":1087120,"title":"","content":"The font used for headers bugs me as hard to read, but it really bugs me that any special character like \u00fc or \u00e1 or \u00e6 look like they're not bold like the other characters are. Notable in the Dark-Kin and Nunnehi sections.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12635-tomofviledarkness","name":"TomOfVileDarkness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12635_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-03T06:23:37-07:00","id":1087129,"title":"","content":"Hello,<br /> <br /> Can you add this two backer names in Changeling 20th backer list please ? We have made a pledge (store level) with Trollune store (france, Lyon) :<br /> <br /> - Batronoban<br /> - David &quot;Wush&quot; Santiago<br /> <br /> Thank you very much <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2809,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2809-batro","user":"batro","date":". 05-03-2017, 09:43 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2809-batro","name":"batro","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"24"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-03T06:26:01-07:00","id":1087131,"title":"","content":"Sure:<br /> There is a oddity in page 185. After title on probation, there is a table for animal features, and after a text on next page.<br /> <br /> Maybe:<br /> Faerie Eternity (1pt. Merit) (page 186), seems as 1 point, but previous edition, it was 5 point.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":7562,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7562-kokorowatari","user":"KokoroWatari","date":". 05-03-2017, 09:29 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7562-kokorowatari","name":"KokoroWatari","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7562_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"58"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-03T07:41:02-07:00","id":1087144,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>KokoroWatari</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1086773-c20-backer-pdf-errata-thread?p=1087131#post1087131\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Maybe:<br /> Faerie Eternity (1pt. Merit) (page 186), seems as 1 point, but previous edition, it was 5 point.</div> </div> </div> </div>I see no mistake in this one! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>...","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5211-firkraag","name":"Firkraag","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5211_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"381"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-03T08:04:20-07:00","id":1087161,"title":"","content":"Page 55: &quot;Changeling will create any raiment they need&quot; should be &quot;Changeling<b>s</b> will create any raiment they need.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://rpg.drivethrustuff.com/product/134196/Chuubos-Marvelous-WishGranting-Engine\" target=\"_blank\">Chuubo's Marvelous Wish-Granting Engine RPG</a> \u2014 <a href=\"http://www.patreon.com/JennaMoran\" target=\"_blank\">Jenna Moran's Patreon</a> \u2014 <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/user?u=451515\" target=\"_blank\">Robert Vance's Patreon</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/215-rand-brittain","name":"Rand Brittain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar215_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-03T08:08:15-07:00","id":1087164,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#DDDDDD\"><span style=\"font-family:-apple-system\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">p 105, On Satyrs:<br /> Looks like there's a missing word:</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#DDDDDD\"><span style=\"font-family:-apple-system\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">&quot;For all their passion, they /KNOW/ nothing of true love or romance.&quot;</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#DDDDDD\"><span style=\"font-family:-apple-system\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">p 115, Step Three: Birthrights</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#DDDDDD\"><span style=\"font-family:-apple-system\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">The last sentence of the first section says: &quot;The four categories of Birthrights are as follows:\u201d</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#DDDDDD\"><span style=\"font-family:-apple-system\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Immediately following, I see three categories: Acuity, Magic, and Advantage.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#DDDDDD\"><span style=\"font-family:-apple-system\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">p 194 / 195 - Bunks:</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#DDDDDD\"><span style=\"font-family:-apple-system\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">The text on p 194 says: &quot;Spending a turn dancing a waltz would yield a \u20131 difficulty in most circumstances, but performing an elaborate, ritualized dance at 11:11PM every day for three days would likely lower the difficulty by 5.\u201d</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#DDDDDD\"><span style=\"font-family:-apple-system\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">The chart on p 195 says: &quot;Repeating an elaborate ritual at the same time over 3 days\u201d is -4</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#DDDDDD\"><span style=\"font-family:-apple-system\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">It seems like the intent of these is to be the same example; if it isn\u2019t, then one of them probably needs a little clarification to express the difference.</span></span></span><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13361-orbus","name":"Orbus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-03T08:22:58-07:00","id":1087174,"title":"","content":"p3 - and friends don\u2019t <u>beleive</u> in your true fae nature.<br /> So how far will you go in search of wonders?<br /> \u2014 Serhii \u201cSelerian\u201d Poroshkin<br /> <br /> ----- <u>believe</u> !<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2809-batro","name":"batro","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"24"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-03T08:41:16-07:00","id":1087181,"title":"","content":"Wade-Giles Romanization has formatting that would change certain Hsien kith names. The Hou-chi follow it, but the Chu Jung should be listed as Chu-jung, the Fu Hsi as Fu-hsi, and as for the Chu-ih-yu, ih alone isn't a sound in Mandarin. Literally; an -ih ending indicates empty rime, where you draw out the sound of the preceding consonant paired to the vowel instead of having a vowel sound, so if there's no consonant, there's no sound (so the name of the Shih demon hunters, for example, sounds like a clipped version of the English word &quot;sure&quot;). I also remain very sure that Ch'ih-yu would be a better choice for the kith name, since the Wormy Rebel is a figure of legend in keeping with some of the other kamuii's names, and was typically depicted as a man with metal skin.<br /> <br /> (Heng Po appears to be in Hanyu Pinyin. It gets to stand out without the dash. Also, po is pronounced more like paw than poe; the latter would be pou.)<br /> <br /> Edit: Also, hsien-jin sounds like it might be treading on the same poor ground as the term Kuei-jin. The Mandarin reading, assuming you're looking for &quot;person&quot;, would be hsien-jen.<br /> <br /> Edit 2: Also, shui-jen instead of suijen, unless you're changing it to the Japanese Suijin (lit. water deities).<br /> <br /> Edit 3: Probably the last silent addition, but would it perhaps be possible to change the seeming hsien-jin to hsien-jen (assuming that you meant \u4eba)?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":23,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","user":"Saur Ops Specialist","date":". 05-17-2017, 11:18 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-03T08:44:28-07:00","id":1087183,"title":"","content":"on page 366 it says that Pervasive Paracosm-Fixation Disorder was created to rationalize the naturali abilitys of kithain kinain and fae touched... but it doesnt, rationalize their abilitys at all just their beliefs so I think this is a typo...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"imag